<title>USA: Republic to issue 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Republic to issue 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Bancorp Inc said Friday its board of directors approved a 10 percent stock dividend and the repurchase of up to 9.9 percent of the company's outstanding shares after the dividend.  </p>
<p>The company also said it will maintain its quarterly $0.10 a share dividend rate following the stock dividend. Reflecting the stock dividend, the cash dividend will represent a 22 percent increase over the year ago period, the company said.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be issued December 2 to shareholders of record November 4, the $1.5 billion bank holding company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
